위 작곡가 칼하인츠 슈토크하우젠이 작곡한 음악극 ‘오리기나레(Originale)’ 무대에 올라 행위 예술을 선보였다.","date":"2026-01-28T20:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/29/5UZKHXEY6VGJ5KGGEFNDOGGEOA/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"‘단색화 거장’ 정상화 화백 별세","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-28T15:43:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/29/3SBF7XJQANDWDE2TWX4AW4QCIQ/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"호주 섬에서 수영하던 소녀의 죽음...딩고가 유력한 용의자로 떠올랐다","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-27T18:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/2026/01/28/I62QESTCGRFDZNI2UUKRCZJCEE/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"‘태평무’ 강선영 선생 기제사 봉행","partialText":"","date":"2026-01-28T15:43:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/01/29/OKAFPP2FHBBD7GLWPIYSMTPICM/"}]